Reason:
The reliance on the global variable `qpt_mask` meant that all instances of the driver shared the same value, which could lead to incorrect resource allocation when multiple devices were used simultaneously. This could cause conflicts in the allocation of queue pairs (QPs) as the same `qpt_mask` would be applied across different devices, leading to potential mismanagement of resources.

